{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50755","headline":"杭州晚眺 · 张祜","name":"杭州晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万仞危峯厌渺漫，碧云梢上倚栏干。\n云横海鴈天风夕，月照城鵶水雾寒。\n行客待潮来远渡，居人瞻火去平滩。\n萧条醉卧谁家笛，一曲《梁州》梦里残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}